========================================
SERVICE: PRODUCT SERVICE
========================================

PURPOSE:
Manages bakery products (cakes), pricing, availability, and caching.

----------------------------------------
CORE RESPONSIBILITIES:
----------------------------------------
- Manage product catalog (5 cake flavors)
- Provide product listing APIs
- Cache product data using Redis
- Reduce database load

----------------------------------------
FEATURES IMPLEMENTED:
----------------------------------------

1. FIXED PRODUCT CATALOG
- Chocolate
- Vanilla
- Red Velvet
- Black Forest
- Butterscotch

2. PRODUCT FETCH APIs
- Get all products
- Get product by ID

3. REDIS CACHING
- Cache product list
- Cache individual product
- Reduce DB hits

4. CACHE INVALIDATION
- When product updated → clear cache

----------------------------------------
DATABASE:
----------------------------------------

TABLE: product
- id
- name
- price
- description
- available

----------------------------------------
TECH STACK:
----------------------------------------
- Spring Boot
- JPA + MySQL
- Redis
- Lombok

----------------------------------------
SUMMARY:
----------------------------------------
Product Service manages bakery items and uses Redis caching
to improve performance and reduce database load.